WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:18.629
Ben's heart pounded in his chest.

2
00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:22.546
Meanwhile the wall's shaking had grown louder.

3
00:00:22.547 --> 00:00:24.802
Rebecca Gold spoke up.

4
00:00:24.803 --> 00:00:27.910
"I'd like to try your mac and cheese."

5
00:00:27.911 --> 00:00:30.389
"Really?" Ben said.

6
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:34.281
"Really?" the two other judges said in shock.

7
00:00:34.282 --> 00:00:38.886
"Yes." Rebecca Gold picked up a fork.

8
00:00:38.887 --> 00:00:41.862
"I believe it's important to try new things."

9
00:00:41.863 --> 00:00:44.058
She glanced at the other judges.

10
00:00:44.059 --> 00:00:47.327
"You two have no sense of adventure."

11
00:00:47.328 --> 00:00:51.423
Rumble! Rumble! The wall shook violently.

12
00:00:51.424 --> 00:01:02.228
Ben tried to ignore it as he spooned out some of his mac and cheese for Rebecca Gold.

13
00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:08.589
"It smells wonderful, Ben." The judge took some on her fork and lifted it toward her mouth.

14
00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:11.211
Rumble! Rumble!

15
00:01:11.212 --> 00:01:15.457
"Can someone please fix that wall?" Bolton Ramsey shouted.

16
00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:18.929
"It's driving me absolutely—"

17
00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:25.667
Ka-boom! The wall exploded, and a tidal wave of hot sauce flowed into the room.

18
00:01:25.668 --> 00:01:31.700
Cameras and lights sizzled and melted as the hot sauce bubbled up around them.

19
00:01:31.701 --> 00:01:36.406
Crew members tripped over one another, all trying to reach the door.

20
00:01:36.407 --> 00:01:41.688
"What is wrong with this place?" Bolton Ramsey shouted.

21
00:01:41.689 --> 00:01:44.640
Mayor Hubbletree held up his hands.

22
00:01:44.641 --> 00:01:51.748
"Everyone, please remain calm! Everything is totally under control!"

23
00:01:51.749 --> 00:01:56.308
"You call this 'under control'?" Viv Stryder cried.

24
00:01:56.309 --> 00:01:59.618
"I knew it was a bad idea to film here."

25
00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:04.691
She climbed onto a table to escape the hot sauce.

26
00:02:04.692 --> 00:02:09.231
"Yikes!" Mayor Hubbletree cried as the sauce oozed toward him.

27
00:02:09.232 --> 00:02:12.240
The mayor scrambled onto a chair.

28
00:02:12.241 --> 00:02:16.164
"Where's Freaky? This is his fault!"

29
00:02:16.165 --> 00:02:18.354
Ben looked around.

30
00:02:18.355 --> 00:02:22.855
The principal was huddled in a corner with his face in his hands.

31
00:02:22.856 --> 00:02:24.643
Bolton Ramsey stood up.

32
00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:31.226
"I'm leaving!" He stormed out of the room, with Margaret Oh following him.

33
00:02:31.227 --> 00:02:34.181
Rebecca Gold was still sitting at the table.

34
00:02:34.182 --> 00:02:39.311
"Well, Ben. Let's try this mac and cheese of yours."

35
00:02:39.312 --> 00:02:48.243
She took a bite.

36
00:02:48.244 --> 00:02:51.045
"Mmm. Delicious!"

37
00:02:51.046 --> 00:02:54.486
Ben was shocked. "Really?"

38
00:02:54.487 --> 00:02:58.790
The judge nodded. "I love monster food.

39
00:02:58.791 --> 00:03:02.869
My husband is a ghoul, you know.

40
00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:08.223
If I can give you a bit of advice, try a few more lizard tails next time.

41
00:03:08.224 --> 00:03:09.662
But it's not important.

42
00:03:09.663 --> 00:03:12.900
This is absolutely enchanting."

43
00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:16.283
"Gee, thanks," Ben said.

44
00:03:16.284 --> 00:03:19.365
Rebecca Gold looked around at the chaos.

45
00:03:19.366 --> 00:03:21.571
A lightbulb exploded.

46
00:03:21.572 --> 00:03:28.831
A cameraman held a half-melted camera in his hands. Wires sizzled.

47
00:03:28.832 --> 00:03:33.759
"I suppose I should go now," Rebecca Gold said.

48
00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:42.238
"Good luck, Ben. Don't stop cooking—you're very talented."

49
00:03:42.239 --> 00:03:46.724
She leaped over a pool of hot sauce and walked out of the room.

50
00:03:46.725 --> 00:03:52.174
Viv Stryder hopped down from the table and made her way to the door.

51
00:03:52.175 --> 00:03:58.422
Mayor Hubbletree followed her, wincing when he stepped in a hot sauce puddle.

52
00:03:58.423 --> 00:04:01.166
"Miss Stryder!" he called.

53
00:04:01.167 --> 00:04:08.218
"Please wait! Let's reschedule and film the show at the People Place Middle School, like you suggested!"

54
00:04:08.219 --> 00:04:10.310
Viv Stryder spun around.

55
00:04:10.311 --> 00:04:19.221
"Are you kidding? Sorry, Mayor, but this episode of Kids' Kitchen Showdown has been canceled!"

56
00:04:19.222 --> 00:04:21.970
The mayor's shoulders slumped.

57
00:04:21.971 --> 00:04:24.908
Mr. Freaky wandered over to the mayor.

58
00:04:24.909 --> 00:04:27.820
They both pulled out their handkerchiefs.

59
00:04:27.821 --> 00:04:30.866
Mayor Hubbletree wiped his brow.

60
00:04:30.867 --> 00:04:35.395
"Why do things like this constantly happen around here, Freaky?

61
00:04:35.396 --> 00:04:40.943
You all seem like good people, er, monsters."

62
00:04:40.944 --> 00:04:45.460
Mr. Freaky blew his noses.

63
00:04:45.461 --> 00:04:55.103
"I don't know, Mayor. I really don't know."

64
00:04:55.104 --> 00:04:59.519
The next day Ben was at home getting ready for Winnie's party.

65
00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:03.461
He placed the necklace in a small box and wrapped it.

66
00:05:03.462 --> 00:05:08.150
"I hope Winnie likes this necklace," he thought as he tied the ribbon.

67
00:05:08.151 --> 00:05:13.987
Meow! The kitten swatted at Ben's feet.

68
00:05:13.988 --> 00:05:18.487
"You have a lot of energy today," he said to the kitten.

69
00:05:18.488 --> 00:05:24.878
He'd made a few phone calls about a home for the kitten, but so far nobody wanted it.

70
00:05:24.879 --> 00:05:30.977
The kitten leaped up, nearly knocking the gift out of Ben's hand.

71
00:05:30.978 --> 00:05:38.430
When Ben turned to leave, the kitten followed.

72
00:05:38.431 --> 00:05:43.336
It hopped through the open door and ran down the front steps.

73
00:05:43.375 --> 00:05:51.293
Ben sighed. "You can't come with me. Go back inside!"

74
00:05:51.294 --> 00:05:57.201
He held the door open, but the kitten ignored him.

75
00:05:57.202 --> 00:06:02.098
It was getting late. Winnie and Gaby would be back at Winnie's house soon.

76
00:06:02.099 --> 00:06:05.334
Ben didn't have time to argue with a kitten.

77
00:06:05.335 --> 00:06:08.592
He shut the door and floated down the street.

78
00:06:08.593 --> 00:06:13.547
The kitten followed, jumping up and swatting at his feet.

79
00:06:13.548 --> 00:06:15.555
"Stop it," Ben said.

80
00:06:15.556 --> 00:06:22.157
As he turned to scold the kitten, he floated into a tree.

81
00:06:22.158 --> 00:06:24.245
"Ugh!" Ben cried.

82
00:06:24.246 --> 00:06:30.135
"I'm stuck!" He gritted his teeth and tried to move.

83
00:06:30.136 --> 00:06:35.126
"This is unbelievable! I haven't gotten stuck like this in a long time.

84
00:06:35.127 --> 00:06:37.488
It's all because of this annoying kitten!"

85
00:06:37.489 --> 00:06:42.724
Just then the kitten jumped up, leaping for the ribbon on the gift.

86
00:06:42.725 --> 00:06:48.694
Ben watched in horror as the gift flew out of his hand and sailed toward a storm drain.

87
00:06:48.695 --> 00:06:54.258
"No!" Ben cried as the gift slid into the drain.
